                , Cah. Top. Géom. Diff. Cat.
                %strong XLIIX
                no.3 (2007) pp.220-228. (
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item?id=CTGDC_2007__48_3_220_0"}> numdam
                )
            %li
              %p
