                ,
                %em Localisation, spectra and sheaf representation
                , pp.212-238 in Fourman, Mulvey &amp; Scott (eds.),
                %em Applications of Sheaves
                , Springer LNM
                %strong 753
                (1979).
            %li
              %p
                M. Coste, G. Michon,
                %em Petits et Gros Topos en Géométrie Algébrique
                , Cah. Top. Géom. Diff. Cat.
                %strong XXII
                no.1 (1981) pp.25-30. (
                %a{:href => "http://archive.numdam.org/article/CTGDC_1981__22_1_25_0.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eduardo+Dubuc"}> E. J. Dubuc
                ,
                %em Axiomatic etal maps and a theory of spectrum
                , JPAA
                %strong 149
                (2000) pp.15-45.
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                L. Español,
                %em Le spectre d’un anneau dans l’algèbre constructive et applications à la dimension
                , Cah. Top. Géom. Diff. Cat.
                %strong XXIV
                no.2 (1983) pp.133-144. (
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/numdam-bin/item?id=CTGDC_1983__24_2_133_0"}> numdam
                )
            %li
              %p
                L. Español,
                %em El Espectro y la Dimension des Anillos en el Algebra sobre un Topos
                , Revista Colombiana de Matemáticas
                %strong XX
                (1986) pp.105-128. (
                %a{:href => "http://gdz.sub.uni-goettingen.de/dms/load/img/?PID=GDZPPN002541068"}> gdz
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ren%C3%A9+Guitart"}> R. Guitart
